Changes in this repository: the book's notebook code has been reorganized into
per-chapter Python modules that import from one another, and GPT-2 weights are
loaded from Hugging Face safetensors instead of the original TensorFlow checkpoint.

the-verdict.txt is "The Verdict" by Edith Wharton (1908), which is in the public domain.
